Alright! I don't need any half-
hearted punks from here on out!

00:15:56.456 --> 00:15:58.257
I'll leave them all behind!

00:15:58.424 --> 00:16:01.561
Hey, moron! I'm putting
my whole heart into it!

00:16:01.561 --> 00:16:05.097
Then show me your
wholeheartedness!

00:16:05.097 --> 00:16:07.133
Just what I wanted to hear!

00:16:07.767 --> 00:16:10.303
Down with Halekulani!

00:16:12.038 --> 00:16:13.539
Down with Halekulani!

00:16:13.539 --> 00:16:14.807
Tennosuke 100T
Down with Halekulani!

00:16:14.807 --> 00:16:15.074
Down with Halekulani!

00:16:15.374 --> 00:16:17.210
Down with Halekulani!

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:18.578
Halikulini...

00:16:18.578 --> 00:16:20.079
Hariyakulani...

00:16:20.646 --> 00:16:25.585
Down with Halekulani!

00:16:25.718 --> 00:16:27.420
Cut it out, guys!

00:16:28.054 --> 00:16:30.490
What are you three doing, anyway?

00:16:30.857 --> 00:16:31.891
| wouldn't worry.

00:16:32.625 --> 00:16:36.596
This is how they psych each other up

00:16:36.596 --> 00:16:38.397
to prepare for the final battle.

00:16:38.397 --> 00:16:39.565
Oh, that's how it is!

00:16:43.236 --> 00:16:45.638
Okay, let's... roll out.

00:16:46.072 --> 00:16:49.008
But you're all practically dead!

00:16:49.008 --> 00:16:51.477
Hey! Halekulani!

00:16:51.477 --> 00:16:52.945
Come on out, will ya?

00:16:52.945 --> 00:16:55.014
We'll kick your ass, punk!

00:16:55.014 --> 00:16:56.282
They're suddenly better...

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.784
Bring it on!

00:16:58.784 --> 00:17:00.486
Hey, hey, hey!

00:17:08.661 --> 00:17:09.829
Here it is.

00:17:19.572 --> 00:17:20.640
The entrance...

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:24.477
Halekulani! Where are you hiding?
Show yourself!

00:17:25.578 --> 00:17:28.347
What's happening?
There's money falling from the sky!

00:17:28.748 --> 00:17:29.782
Where is he?

00:17:33.519 --> 00:17:35.388
Welcome to Money Castle.

00:17:36.022 --> 00:17:38.157
| waited far too long for you, pests.

00:17:45.331 --> 00:17:46.499
Halekulani!

00:17:49.735 --> 00:17:50.770
Bo-bobo!

00:17:50.937 --> 00:17:54.907
The money in the air is
infused with Halekulani's will!

00:17:54.907 --> 00:17:56.676
You mustn't touch it!

00:17:58.711 --> 00:18:00.379
What the heck are you two doing?

00:18:00.379 --> 00:18:02.114
| just told you not to touch it!

00:18:02.114 --> 00:18:04.383
Money, money, money...!

00:18:04.383 --> 00:18:08.754
Hey! Weren't you just shouting
"Down with Halekulani” just a minute ago?

00:18:11.757 --> 00:18:15.127
Halekulani! I'm gonna come up
there and kick your rich keister!

00:18:15.127 --> 00:18:15.795
Bo-bobo!

00:18:15.795 --> 00:18:16.128
Bo-bobo's Share
Bo-bobo!

00:18:16.128 --> 00:18:17.029
Bo-bobo's Share

00:18:17.029 --> 00:18:18.864
Bo-bobo's Share
Have at you!

00:18:18.864 --> 00:18:20.232
Bo-bobo's Share
He's only saying it!

00:18:23.536 --> 00:18:25.204
Now I can die happy.

00:18:25.204 --> 00:18:26.439
Why!?

00:18:26.706 --> 00:18:30.810
- Money, money, money...!
- I said stop it already!

00:18:30.977 --> 00:18:33.212
Drop the money! It's dangerous!

00:18:33.212 --> 00:18:37.016
| worked for 35 years to make this money!
I'm not letting you cheat me out of it!

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:38.718
What the...?

00:18:39.552 --> 00:18:40.319
Get away!

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.021
Suzu!

00:18:42.154 --> 00:18:43.189
Suzu!

00:18:46.525 --> 00:18:47.593
Did she just...?

00:18:49.762 --> 00:18:50.930
Suzu...

00:18:56.669 --> 00:19:00.139
Halekulani! Damn you!

00:19:02.475 --> 00:19:05.478
He can turn people into money?
What a terrible technique!

00:19:07.179 --> 00:19:09.548
At this rate, Beauty
will be in danger, too!

00:19:10.249 --> 00:19:12.218
We gotta blow the money away first!

00:19:12.218 --> 00:19:16.422
How do we do that? Hey, tell me!
How do we do that?

00:19:16.922 --> 00:19:19.458
Bo-bobo Typhoon!

00:19:19.992 --> 00:19:22.628
It's working!
The money's blowing away!

00:19:24.363 --> 00:19:26.866
They're getting hit on purpose!

00:19:26.866 --> 00:19:28.401
You're too heavy!

00:19:28.734 --> 00:19:30.736
Money's nothing more than paper!

00:19:30.736 --> 00:19:35.107
If we feed them all to a goat,
who loves eating paper, we'll be fine!

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.613
Fist of the Nose Hair
Secret Technique:

00:19:43.916 --> 00:19:45.384
Summon Goat!

00:19:45.384 --> 00:19:47.720
But that's obviously a giraffe!

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.189
Eat all the paper you like!

00:19:50.189 --> 00:19:51.290
Don't mind if I do.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.792
Is that how you eat it?

00:19:53.793 --> 00:19:56.128
You see... when we were young,

00:19:56.128 --> 00:20:00.066
we goats couldn't even
afford to eat paper...

00:20:00.066 --> 00:20:01.767
But you're a giraffe.

00:20:03.302 --> 00:20:05.971
Now he's sending coins!
Let's go, Don Patch!

00:20:05.971 --> 00:20:06.772
Yeah!

00:20:09.408 --> 00:20:11.777
Allow me to use this coin!

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:15.014
Grand Prize!

00:20:15.014 --> 00:20:16.682
Coin Beauty
Grand Prize!

00:20:16.682 --> 00:20:17.750
Coin Beauty
What the heck is this?

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:18.150
What the heck is this?

00:20:21.153 --> 00:20:24.090
That's a lot of weird me's!

00:20:25.124 --> 00:20:26.992
Beauty Flash!

00:20:27.827 --> 00:20:30.362
The weird me actually
does something important!

00:20:36.502 --> 00:20:39.438
This money just keeps on coming,
no matter how much we blow away!

00:20:39.438 --> 00:20:42.041
We'll never reach him at this rate!

00:20:42.041 --> 00:20:43.209
Bo-bobo!

00:20:43.609 --> 00:20:48.714
Even if his money touches us, it still
takes two or three seconds to wrap us up!

00:20:48.714 --> 00:20:52.451
How about we make a mad
dash straight to him, instead?

00:20:52.451 --> 00:20:53.786
That's a good idea!

00:20:53.786 --> 00:20:56.689
Alright! We'll go with
that plan, Dengakuman!

00:20:56.822 --> 00:20:57.490
OK!

00:20:59.558 --> 00:21:00.559
Go!

00:21:00.893 --> 00:21:02.962
So why did you do this to me?

00:21:03.596 --> 00:21:07.600
Alright! At this speed, we can shake
off the money before it wraps us up!

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:11.370
Now we can throw a
punch into that damn face!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.742
What!?

00:21:17.643 --> 00:21:19.078
Fist of the Wobble-wobble
Secret Technique:

00:21:19.979 --> 00:21:20.079
Limb Ex-Ten-sion!

00:21:20.079 --> 00:21:21.814
Limb Ex-Ten-sion
Limb Ex-Ten-sion!

00:21:21.814 --> 00:21:22.014
Limb Ex-Ten-sion!

00:21:22.014 --> 00:21:23.616
Nice idea, Tennosuke!

00:21:23.616 --> 00:21:26.418
But Bo-bobo...
We can't go any further now!

00:21:26.819 --> 00:21:28.087
Good point.

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.190
No way... There's money
floating above them...

00:21:31.190 --> 00:21:34.093
And there's a huge pool
of money below them...

00:21:34.426 --> 00:21:38.197
How are they supposed to
get to Halekulani now?

00:21:39.799 --> 00:21:42.902
We've made it out of
every crisis so far.

00:21:42.902 --> 00:21:45.905
Bo-bobo's sure to think of something!

00:21:45.905 --> 00:21:47.139
Bo-bobo!

00:21:47.306 --> 00:21:51.010
| can't see him anywhere!
Could he have fallen?

00:21:51.243 --> 00:21:52.077
What?

00:21:52.077 --> 00:21:53.112
No...

00:21:53.813 --> 00:21:57.449
Bo-bobo!

00:21:57.550 --> 00:22:01.687
Bo-bobo!

00:22:01.687 --> 00:22:02.688
Yeah?

00:22:05.391 --> 00:22:06.959
Softon! Over there!

00:22:08.994 --> 00:22:11.664
Fist of the Nose Hair
Secret Technique: Gondola Tour!

00:22:11.664 --> 00:22:12.398
Gondola?

00:22:12.398 --> 00:22:14.400
Did you have that all along?

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:15.701
Take this!

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:21.874
He did it!

00:22:26.412 --> 00:22:28.848
Consider that my hello, snob.

00:22:29.248 --> 00:22:31.417
That was quite good.

00:22:31.784 --> 00:22:34.053
I never thought you'd
clear the Money Trap.

00:22:34.053 --> 00:22:35.721
Money Trap?

00:22:38.524 --> 00:22:40.459
It was nothing.

00:22:40.893 --> 00:22:43.128
It was not nothing!

00:22:43.863 --> 00:22:45.831
The final battle has finally begun!

00:22:46.565 --> 00:22:49.134
Will Bo-bobo defeat Halekulani,

00:22:49.134 --> 00:22:52.238
and rescue Suzu who
was turned into a coin?

00:22:55.407 --> 00:22:56.742
Somebody help me!

00:22:56.742 --> 00:22:58.577
Help me, too!

00:23:00.646 --> 00:23:01.747
Thanks for the meal.

00:23:01.747 --> 00:23:04.783
Huh? You were still eating?
Help me out here!

00:23:06.218 --> 00:23:07.686
Yeah yeah!

00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:09.688
Peace to all.

00:23:09.688 --> 00:23:10.322
Right?

00:23:12.391 --> 00:23:14.026
Everyone who wants to
shout come on over!!

00:23:14.026 --> 00:23:15.527
We'll all burst out laughing!
Burst out running!

00:23:20.432 --> 00:23:22.001
Everyone who wants to
cause a riot come on over!!

00:23:22.001 --> 00:23:23.569
We'll all burst out laughing!
Burst out running!

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:29.975
Alright then, everyone, bottoms up!

00:23:29.975 --> 00:23:32.044
Everyone raise your
hands and shout "Hooray"!

00:23:32.044 --> 00:23:34.346
All you who want to party
like there's no rules...

00:23:34.346 --> 00:23:36.282
Keep on, keep on jamming?

00:23:36.382 --> 00:23:41.420
As we get mad, cry, and laugh...

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:43.989
