00:23:44.089 --> 00:23:45.991
Yo! Are you gonna miss
the bus and show up late!?

00:23:45.991 --> 00:23:47.960
My manual drive is
raising the tension gage.

00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:50.162
<i>I say "I can do it!"
and fill up with confidence.</i>

