Here's the results of the
Janken Fortune Teller, nah-na-la!

00:24:28.467 --> 00:24:33.739
If you won, you'll be lucky if you
expand your field of activities!

00:24:34.073 --> 00:24:37.643
Your lucky item is a gondola
