00:24:44.616 --> 00:24:49.755
And if you lost, be careful not to
squeeze wasabi tubes too hard!

00:24:49.755 --> 00:24:52.024
Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo

00:24:52.591 --> 00:24:55.094
How do we deal with someone
who uses money as a weapon?

00:24:55.094 --> 00:24:57.396
This is looking bad! What do we do?

00:24:57.396 --> 00:24:59.965
We have a gorgeous guy
of our own, remember!

00:25:00.099 --> 00:25:01.233
Who's that?

00:25:01.233 --> 00:25:03.202
Anyone want some tokoroten?

00:25:03.202 --> 00:25:05.371
Tennosuke for 10 yen!

00:25:05.371 --> 00:25:07.439
That's cheap! We can't win with that!

